{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5083, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4025, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9255, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6661, "text": "Criminal court part two\nis now in session."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11365, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9431, "text": "The honorable..."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 23202, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17138, "text": "And semi-mystical,\nHarold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 28004, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25513, "text": "All right, sit down."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 29678, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28450, "text": "Nobody even blinked."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 31216, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29851, "text": "I guess they're used to you."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 35015, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31386, "text": "- You mean...?\n- The thrill is gone, yes, sir."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 37520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35256, "text": "Uh, here's the docket."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 40490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37692, "text": "Now all we need are the attorneys."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 45622, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43131, "text": "Bull, where are Dan and Billie?"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 52069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49771, "text": "Not here, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 55600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52540, "text": "They had to run to city hall.\nThey're both up for an appointment..."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 58575, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55777, "text": "...with the new commission\non crime and youthful offenders."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 60977, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58747, "text": "- Then maybe they're stuck in traffic.\n- Yeah."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 64141, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61149, "text": "I know, I know, I'm late.\nI am terribly sorry, forgive me."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 66446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64319, "text": "I am ashamed, I beg your apology..."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 69556, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66621, "text": "...and I promise the court\nthat it will never happen again."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 70782, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69724, "text": "Dan's not here, either."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 75521, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70959, "text": "Can you believe his nerve,\nkeeping us waiting like this?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 79124, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76064, "text": "- How'd the interview go, counselor?\n- Not bad."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 82929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79300, "text": "I think I demonstrated a lot of knowledge\nabout crime problems and kids."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 84332, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83104, "text": "Great. What about Dan?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 85973, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84506, "text": "He took another approach."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 89133, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86141, "text": "<i>Fielding, Fielding, Fielding.</i>"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 92177, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89310, "text": "<i>Fielding, Fielding, Fielding.</i>"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 95043, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92347, "text": "<i>- Fielding, Fielding, Fielding.\n- All right. Let me down.</i>"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 96877, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95216, "text": "Come on, guys, let me down."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 98849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97052, "text": "- Fielding.\n- Ha, ha."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 101386, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99020, "text": "- Hi.\n- You're late."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 104684, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101556, "text": "I know, and I tried to tell them."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 108260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104859, "text": "Doesn't it do your heart good\nto see such an outpouring of affection?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 109795, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108430, "text": "You paid those kids."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 111932, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109964, "text": "- Not yet, he hasn't.\n- Hey, later."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 116062, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113468, "text": "What a lovely gang of lads, huh?"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 119001, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116237, "text": "And surprisingly affordable too, I'll bet."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 121735, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 119574, "text": "Well, they do receive a small stipend..."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 125346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121910, "text": "...but it's part of a work-study program\nthat I established."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 128209, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125513, "text": "- You're buying their support.\n- No, no, no."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 131113, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128383, "text": "I'm teaching them\nthat I can buy their support."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 133846, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131286, "text": "Say, what about that first case, huh?\nBull."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 135421, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134022, "text": "What do we got, Mac?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 140721, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 135590, "text": "Seven counts of lewd and immoral conduct,\nfive counts of prostitution..."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 143523, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140895, "text": "...couple of counts of intent\nto commit acts of prostitution."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 146531, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143698, "text": "- Whoa, all by one person?\n- No, sir, we have four defendants."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 149499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146701, "text": "<i>People v. Tawny LaBelle...</i>"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 155041, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149671, "text": "<i>... Cynthia Peters, Pattie Valentine,\nand my wife.</i>"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 203621, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201289, "text": "- Well...\n- Quon Le, what the hell is this all about?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 205356, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204025, "text": "Hi, Mac."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 207392, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205527, "text": "That is my husband."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 209154, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 207562, "text": "You never mentioned being married."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 211355, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 209330, "text": "Oh, yes. Four months ago."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 213831, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 211533, "text": "But I haven't seen him\nsince the wedding."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 217267, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214002, "text": "- This what they call an open relationship?\n- Excuse me..."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 221067, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217438, "text": "Actually, Mac is just sort of\ntemporarily acting in the role of spouse."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 225076, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221242, "text": "That's all we did,\nand we got busted for it."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 227737, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225246, "text": "- Well, perhaps...\n- Mac and Quon Le are legally married."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 230180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227916, "text": "It's a formality,\nso she can stay in the country."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 233616, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230351, "text": "- Well, isn't that illegal?\n- Well, of course it is."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 235517, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233788, "text": "Say, when did I lose control?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 238985, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236824, "text": "- Right off the bat, huh?\nYour Honor."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 240184, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239160, "text": "Miss Young."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 245126, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240962, "text": "As far as I can tell, Quon Le just happened\nto be in the wrong place at the wrong time."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 246324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245300, "text": "It's true."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 247900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246501, "text": "I had no place to stay..."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 251664, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248069, "text": "...so my new American friends\nlet me be their roommate."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 257209, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251839, "text": "According to this report, they let\nthe entire merchant fleet be their roommate."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 261346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257979, "text": "My clients have indicated\nthey'd be willing to plead no contest..."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 265452, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261516, "text": "...on the first three charges\nprovided prosecution drops the rest."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 266985, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265620, "text": "- Agreed.\n- Peachy."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 268850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267155, "text": "Court finds the defendants guilty."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 270149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269023, "text": "All the defendants?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 272418, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270325, "text": "Correction,\nQuon Le Duc is found not guilty..."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 277031, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272594, "text": "...by reason of excessive innocence."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 278856, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277832, "text": "Thank you, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 284027, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279033, "text": "Now, as for Tawny and the Tawnettes here,\nlet's make it 10 days."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 285570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284205, "text": "- Oh, come on.\nBull."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 288671, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286874, "text": "Uh, could I, sir?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 292643, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288843, "text": "- Yeah, go talk to her. We'll have a short...\n- Recess."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 294704, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293214, "text": "Sorry, sir, I..."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 296816, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294882, "text": "Forget it."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 302381, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299287, "text": "So how was it with somebody else?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 306618, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304525, "text": "Okay, let's go."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 310091, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306894, "text": "Say, you're sexy."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 313029, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310265, "text": "I know, it's a curse."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 316069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313601, "text": "Quon Le, how'd you wind up\nwith those bimbos?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 319764, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316237, "text": "When we got married, I thought you had\nan apartment on the Lower East Side."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 323399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319941, "text": "I did, but I had to move\nafter the men broke in."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 325239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323578, "text": "Somebody broke into your apartment?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 328377, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325647, "text": "- To put the fire out.\n- You had a fire?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 332511, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328916, "text": "- Yes. My drapes started burning.\n- How did that happen?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 334786, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333421, "text": "Sparks from the couch."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 337517, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335390, "text": "Which was in flames because?"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 339455, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337692, "text": "The microwave exploded."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 341595, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339627, "text": "Due to an erroneous setting while..."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 343731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341763, "text": "Heating a can of Cheez Whiz."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 345695, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343898, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 347664, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345867, "text": "I was trying to make fondue."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 349462, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347835, "text": "Oh, Quon Le."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 351400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349637, "text": "I lost everything, Mac."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 355807, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351973, "text": "The Ginsu knives,\nmy Civil War chess set..."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 359845, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355977, "text": "...my special record albums\nnot available in any store."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 364309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361749, "text": "Why don't I give you money,\nhelp you back on your feet?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 365679, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364485, "text": "You don't have to do that."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 368788, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365853, "text": "- Come on, you obviously got bills and stuff.\n- Yes, a few bills..."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 371686, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368956, "text": "Okay, then don't be embarrassed,\nhow much do you need?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 375454, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371859, "text": "- Eighteen thousand.\n- Eighteen thousand."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 377962, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375630, "text": "Eighteen thousand?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 380057, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379033, "text": "Of these?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 385201, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382403, "text": "What do you think of the new choppers?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 391835, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388343, "text": "- I wouldn't delude myself if I were you.\n- You can't be as qualified as I am."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 395312, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392013, "text": "- Integrity is what I'm talking about.\n- Who is it?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 396507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395483, "text": "- Billie!\n- Dan!"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 398208, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396684, "text": "Come on in."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 400513, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398386, "text": "- I knocked first.\n- I was here first."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 401712, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400688, "text": "- You were not.\n- I was."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 402913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401889, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 404217, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403091, "text": "- Hello.\n- Hello."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 405416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404392, "text": "Something you need?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 407493, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405593, "text": "Your blessing.\n- Excuse me?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 409892, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407662, "text": "It's about the appointment\non the commission."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 412589, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410064, "text": "Yes, sir. They've narrowed it down\nto three finalists."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 414962, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412767, "text": "Me, her,\nand some joker from the Bronx."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 417696, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415136, "text": "Well, congratulations.\nThat's quite an honor, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 422104, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417872, "text": "To have two out of the three chosen\nfrom our truck stop on the road to justice."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 426136, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423611, "text": "Yes, indeed, sir,\nand I am sure that it is a..."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 429545, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426314, "text": "A reflection on the brilliant leadership\nyou provide here at court."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 432151, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429717, "text": "I would be honored\nif you could see your way clear..."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 434015, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432320, "text": "...to endorse my candidacy."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 437487, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434188, "text": "I'd be glad to write a letter\nof recommendation for both of you."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 438682, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437658, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 441226, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438860, "text": "No, what?\n- No, sir."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 443296, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441396, "text": "You see, it has to be one or the other."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 447730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443464, "text": "Otherwise, it's gonna look like a form letter,\nand it won't carry any weight with them."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 449961, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447902, "text": "Sir, for once, she's right."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 452470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450138, "text": "As I see it,\nthis is an either-or situation."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 455541, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452640, "text": "Her or me."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 458909, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456577, "text": "And may the best man win."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 462380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460515, "text": "You guys are putting me in a tough spot."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 465348, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462550, "text": "I mean, basically, you're asking me\nto choose between you."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 469889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465520, "text": "Well, Harry, I don't think\nthat should be so difficult."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 472855, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470057, "text": "Slit skirt, no fair."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 479229, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474462, "text": "The court finds the defendant guilty with a\ntwo-day suspended sentence and a $50 fine."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 482528, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479400, "text": "And, Mr. Conway,\nremember that a funeral at St. Pat's..."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 485228, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482703, "text": "...is no place for a singing telegram."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 486430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485406, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 490810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488376, "text": "Notice how effortlessly\nI cornered the defendant?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 493970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490978, "text": "Dan, the man was wearing\na chicken suit in a cathedral."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 497413, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494148, "text": "Missed the freedom-of-religion angle,\ndidn't you?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 499485, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497585, "text": "Okay, that's lunch, everybody."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 502645, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500154, "text": "Your Honor,\nabout the letter of recommendation..."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 504519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502824, "text": "I haven't made my decision yet, Dan."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 505989, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504692, "text": "Fine. Oh, hey, I understand."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 508060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506160, "text": "Take your time. Do not rush into this."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 513166, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508229, "text": "I'm sure your decision will be fair and just,\nper your usual standards."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 515734, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513334, "text": "I'll be in my office."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 518934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516204, "text": "In a diabetic coma."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 528609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527415, "text": "I think I'm through, Mac."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 530774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528783, "text": "Oh, they get you processed out okay?"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 533045, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530952, "text": "I even got copies of my picture."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 534848, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533221, "text": "- See, one for each of us.\n- Oh."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 536649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535022, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 540157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536824, "text": "I'll just trim out the prisoner number."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 543092, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540328, "text": "Well, goodbye, Mac."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 545232, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543264, "text": "Goodbye."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 546999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545600, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 551265, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548569, "text": "How about... How about lunch?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 553270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551439, "text": "Thanks. But I can't."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 556433, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553441, "text": "- I have to find a place to live.\n- Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 559637, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556611, "text": "Hey, don't worry about me, I'll be fine."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 561577, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559814, "text": "Well, wait."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 564878, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563718, "text": "Well, where you gonna go?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 566349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565052, "text": "I'm not sure."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 571823, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566521, "text": "Shelter, mission.\nI hear the park is nice this time of year."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 573385, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572293, "text": "Oh, Quon Le."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 577928, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576097, "text": "Look, you can't stay with me."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 579726, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578099, "text": "I know, Mac."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 584565, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579901, "text": "Besides, I would never\nask such an imposition..."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 588504, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586274, "text": "...of my husband."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 606382, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604892, "text": "God bless you."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 608961, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606561, "text": "You don't mean it, so don't say it."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 614797, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613034, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 623343, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620374, "text": "I've made my decision, guys.\nCome on in."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 628945, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626681, "text": "We'll let you know."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 655768, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652139, "text": "I got it. I got it."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 659243, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657912, "text": "Ugh."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 669887, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668556, "text": "Whee."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 675525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673694, "text": "Hey, Mac, wanna grab a bite to eat?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 677926, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675696, "text": "I am scum."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 681360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 679233, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 686336, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681535, "text": "No, I'm even lower than scum,\nI am bread mold."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 691039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688809, "text": "I'm not so hungry now."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 694579, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691212, "text": "How cruel can one person be?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 697081, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694749, "text": "There's this guy in Passaic\nthat took a meat cleaver..."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 701517, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697251, "text": "Bull, do you know what I just did?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 703452, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701689, "text": "Does it involve animals?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 706218, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703624, "text": "I just kicked Quon Le out of here."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 708157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706394, "text": "- How come?\n- Exactly."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 710729, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708329, "text": "Exactly. What did she do to deserve that?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 712991, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710898, "text": "The kid doesn't have a penny\nto her name..."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 715965, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713167, "text": "...and I just turned her loose\nto the vultures in the street."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 717536, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716137, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 719138, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717705, "text": "I gotta go find her."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 721934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719306, "text": "She's probably out there\ngetting beat up by some creep..."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 724669, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722109, "text": "...who wants to steal\nthe caps off her teeth."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 725869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724845, "text": "Mac?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 728672, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727148, "text": "Thank you for sharing that."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 752038, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749570, "text": "What took you so long?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 762576, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760915, "text": "Got a minute?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 765048, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762750, "text": "I thought you took it\na little too calmly before."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 767847, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765219, "text": "How could you do it, Harry?\nHow could you give it to him?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 769785, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768022, "text": "That man is a walking slag heap."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 773017, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769957, "text": "That may be,\nbut he's a well-qualified slag heap."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 776561, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773194, "text": "- You like him better!\n- Billie."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 781225, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778165, "text": "Whatever we happen to think\nof Dan's personality..."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 784371, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781402, "text": "...the fact remains\nthat he is a well-qualified attorney..."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 788030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784538, "text": "...who has several more years experience\nat criminal cases than you..."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 792703, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788209, "text": "...so taking everything into consideration,\nI felt I had to give the nod to him."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 794142, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792880, "text": "Well, fine."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 797079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794315, "text": "And also taking everything\ninto consideration, Your Honor..."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 800152, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797251, "text": "...I have decided to transfer\nto someone else's courtroom."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 804121, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800321, "text": "After all, there must be some place\nwhere I rate a little higher..."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 806725, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804291, "text": "...than a colleague\nwith the ethics of a dung beetle."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 807986, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806894, "text": "Billie."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 810062, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808162, "text": "Billie, come on."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 814031, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810231, "text": "Billie, I know you're a little miffed\nright now, but please don't..."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 820704, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815903, "text": "...run your fingernails down the door."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 828039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825980, "text": "Penny for your thoughts."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 832345, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828215, "text": "There you go again,\nthrowing your money around."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 836183, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832520, "text": "Sorry, I only wish to know\nwhy you tell me we should talk..."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 837949, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836357, "text": "...and then say nothing."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 840889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838125, "text": "I'm going over my options in my mind."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 842585, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841061, "text": "- Option?\n- Yeah."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 848929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842763, "text": "See, A, you move in with me,\nand I owe $ 18,000..."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 855269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 849103, "text": "...B, you don't move in with me,\nand I owe $ 18,000."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 857342, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855442, "text": "- There is no C?\n- Uh-huh."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 861405, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858379, "text": "I get hit by a bus, and I die..."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 865279, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861582, "text": "...owing $ 18,000."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 867920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865452, "text": "It is not you who owes money, Mac,\nit is I."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 869953, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868088, "text": "Yeah, but you see, you're my wife."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 873389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870124, "text": "And the law says what's yours is mine,\nand what's mine is yours."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 876756, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875596, "text": "Even love?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 879964, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877598, "text": "- What?\n- I love you, Mac."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 881527, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880401, "text": "Oh, Quon Le."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 882828, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881702, "text": "And I miss you."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 885130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883003, "text": "- Quon Le...\n- Yes, Mac?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 890302, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888209, "text": "I missed you too."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 897179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892913, "text": "I guess I didn't realize how much\nuntil I saw you again tonight."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 902754, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899353, "text": "Come on, let's have some lunch and talk."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 906789, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903490, "text": "- I'll buy.\n- Oh, you'll buy?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 910525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907795, "text": "Don't leave home without it."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 914665, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912333, "text": "I thought it was a law."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 917099, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914835, "text": "- No law?\nNo law."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 923404, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922142, "text": "Yeah, come on in."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 934243, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930751, "text": "<i>You ever see Premature Burial\nwith Ray Milland?</i>"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 937421, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936056, "text": "Billie did that."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 942585, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937591, "text": "I know. I saw her down at the cafeteria\ndigging timbers out of her fingers."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 946995, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942763, "text": "Bull, I'm telling you, I expected her\nto be disappointed by my recommendation..."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 950694, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947167, "text": "...but the way she reacted\nwas just totally off the wall."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 954329, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950871, "text": "- Can I say something off the record?\n- Sure."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 957072, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954808, "text": "You're a little dense."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 961245, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958913, "text": "How about we go back on the record?"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 963007, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961415, "text": "She thinks you don't like her."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 966084, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963183, "text": "But my not giving her the recommendation\nwas nothing personal."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 967720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966253, "text": "Yeah, not to you."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 971324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967888, "text": "But she wanted you to say,\n\"You're doing a good job, Billie.\""}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 975360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971492, "text": "She wanted you to say,\n\"I like the way you do things.\""}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 979465, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975529, "text": "We all want approval\nfrom somebody we care about and respect."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 983399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980601, "text": "And, Harry, she cares about you."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 986004, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983570, "text": "And she respects you."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 988764, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987274, "text": "Goodbye."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 991702, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990678, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 994973, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992846, "text": "How did you get so smart, anyway?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1000744, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997718, "text": "I've had some rough lessons in life, sir."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1005858, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000921, "text": "And I've used those experiences to learn,\nand grow and survive."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1010557, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007895, "text": "<i>But mostly, it's from watching Donahue.</i>"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1016631, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014902, "text": "More pickle chips?"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1020433, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016804, "text": "No, those soda crackers\nfilled me right up."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1023371, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020607, "text": "Mac, I am very sorry\nI am the cause of all your troubles."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1025239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023544, "text": "Oh, come on, come on."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1028347, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025412, "text": "You're not the cause of all my troubles."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1032508, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028515, "text": "Although, you've sure helped me\nto forget what the others might be."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1034419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033020, "text": "What's a wife for?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1036249, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034588, "text": "Yeah, right."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1039586, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037891, "text": "Quon Le."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1044926, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041729, "text": "If we actually live together\nas husband and wife..."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1047596, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045366, "text": "I said if."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1050400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048102, "text": "- We'd have lots of problems."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1052869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050571, "text": "All newlyweds have problem."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1054600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053440, "text": "Who told you that?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1055799, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054775, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1058774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055976, "text": "A man named Phil told him."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1062014, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059580, "text": "Quon Le, but we'd have extra problems."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1065549, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062182, "text": "Because even though America\nis the land of liberty and all that..."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1069314, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065719, "text": "...some people haven't accepted the idea\nof two people from different races..."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1071458, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069490, "text": "...living together as man and wife."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1073955, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072226, "text": "Can you accept it?"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1077325, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074128, "text": "Well, of course I can accept it,\nbut it's because I love you."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1079555, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078065, "text": "Aw."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1086666, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083037, "text": "That is the first time\nyou said you love me."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1089408, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087508, "text": "Quon Le..."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1093112, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089676, "text": "...there's a chance it could get ugly."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1095171, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093647, "text": "Mac..."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1100744, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095716, "text": "...I have lived with war\never since I was 5 years old."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1106355, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101588, "text": "My home was destroyed,\nmost of my family were killed."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1112097, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1106727, "text": "And I have lived with that horror\nevery single day of my life."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1117428, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112900, "text": "Tell me, can it get any uglier than that?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1129545, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127247, "text": "I can't stand living in a messy apartment."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1130774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129716, "text": "Cleaning is my hobby."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1134079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130951, "text": "Well, not to mention, I like to watch\na lot of sports on TV."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1136347, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134254, "text": "Go, Cubbies."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1141827, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137925, "text": "Plus, I like three eggs scrambled\nevery day for breakfast."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1144259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141995, "text": "You have them any way you like."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1146695, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144431, "text": "I don't know how to cook."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1152705, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150771, "text": "Oh, what the hell, Quon Le."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1154602, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152873, "text": "If you think you can put up with me..."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1156003, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154775, "text": "I can put up with you."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1157643, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156176, "text": "Say okay."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1164307, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162783, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1166817, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164485, "text": "But the first thing we gotta do\nwhen we get home..."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1171185, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166987, "text": "...is to sit down and figure out exactly\nwhat that 18,000 bucks went for."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1173724, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171358, "text": "- Agreed.\n- Fine."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1184202, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181335, "text": "Did I mention the Buick?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1193304, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192246, "text": "Hi, Billie."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1195948, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194481, "text": "Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1198812, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196116, "text": "Okay, I know you're not too thrilled\nwith me right now..."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1202752, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198986, "text": "...but I'd like to show you\nwhat I have here in my robe."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1205583, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203524, "text": "Don't you dare."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1210661, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207794, "text": "- What is it?\n- Sort of a letter of recommendation."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1212924, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210831, "text": "Thought you could take it with you."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1214533, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213100, "text": "Read it."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1225308, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223443, "text": "\"To whom it may concern.\""}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1227245, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225812, "text": "I stole that."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1232814, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228582, "text": "\"Billie Young is something special.\""}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1235346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233253, "text": "Why beat around the bush?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1240789, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236557, "text": "\"She's got a good head on her shoulders,\nbut more important, she's got a good heart."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1244856, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241762, "text": "She's earned the respect of her peers\nand the affection of friends."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1249765, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245032, "text": "She's a sworn enemy of the smug,\nand the callous, and the corrupt."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1253873, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249937, "text": "Because when it comes\nto other human beings, she's a lover..."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1257166, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254641, "text": "...in the finest sense of the word."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1260510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258645, "text": "In short...\""}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1268244, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262749, "text": "In short, the world is a better place\nbecause Billie Young is in it."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1274419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269356, "text": "Sincerely yours, Judge Harold T. Stone."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1282700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281335, "text": "Harry, this is lovely."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1286295, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284771, "text": "I don't know how to thank you."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1289271, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286473, "text": "You could start by withdrawing\nyour application for transfer."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1293045, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290611, "text": "- I never sent it in.\n- How come?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1295341, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293680, "text": "I was afraid they'd accept it."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1301913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298318, "text": "Come on, I'll fix you a Bartini."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1305454, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303190, "text": "Bosco and vermouth."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1307525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306126, "text": "- You're so crazy.\n- Am not."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1309025, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307694, "text": "- Are to.\n- Am not."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1314090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312566, "text": "Hey, Dan."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1316964, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314268, "text": "Pick a card, any card. Aha!"}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1326034, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322576, "text": "Is it just my imagination,\nor are you a little less than chipper?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1327680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326213, "text": "I just found out it's all over."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1331306, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1327848, "text": "They gave my spot on the commission\nto the other guy."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1333180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331485, "text": "What about my recommendation?"}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1335880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333787, "text": "Toilet paper."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1339822, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338525, "text": "I've got a friend inside."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1343258, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339993, "text": "He said the board chairman\nthought you were too young..."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1346797, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343430, "text": "...and far too flaky to be taken seriously."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1351129, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347534, "text": "- You mean, l...?\n- Destroyed my career, yes."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1354096, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351605, "text": "Well, we do what we can."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1358404, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354274, "text": "You know, I just can't believe they gave it\nto that joker from the Bronx."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1359670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358578, "text": "Dan Fielding?"}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1360870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359846, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1363175, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361048, "text": "I'm the joker from the Bronx."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1367446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365319, "text": "You... You mean, you...?\nOh, well, Father..."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1371050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369890, "text": "Congratulations."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1372452, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1371224, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1374025, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1372626, "text": "Where's Ms. Young?"}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1376890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374194, "text": "I wanted to congratulate her\non a race well run."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1378929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377064, "text": "She's well thought of down at city hall."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1380293, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379099, "text": "She's got a big future."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1382958, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380467, "text": "Uh, heh. Well, what about me?"}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1388073, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383136, "text": "Oh, I heard about you too,\nand believe me, I know you're going places."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1391238, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389509, "text": "Think hot."}
